# CEI Website Standards

## Purpose and Positioning

- Build an institutional, conversion-focused website for the Caribbean Emergence Institute (CEI).
- Position CEI as establishing the legal, governance, financial, and operational foundations of businesses, NPOs, and directors.
- Never present CEI as merely a filing service.

## Technical Standards

- Use Next.js 14+ with the App Router, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.
- Use Lucide React for icons and Framer Motion for animations.
- Preserve accessibility, responsive design, and clear conversion paths.

## Brand Palette

- Primary navy: `#0A2342`
- Teal: `#147266`
- Warm terracotta/copper: `#C85A44`
- Gold accent: `#D4AF37`
- Light background: `#F8FAFC`

## Pricing Disclaimer

Always display this disclaimer wherever pricing or professional fees appear:

> Prices shown are professional fees. Government filing fees, penalties, printing, courier charges, external professional fees and complex legal or accounting work are separate unless expressly included in your written quotation.

